  i guess I could restart the main puzzle but nah!  Tune in on Saturday.

@Classic Hip-Hop Fan - I was planning to go to the ACPT for the first time ever in 2020, but... well I had a lot of travel plans put on hold in 2020. 

I don't solve for speed, and there is no possibility I would win any of the competitions, but I figured it would be a good way to meet some like-minded people. You should just go and have some fun, even if you're nowhere near the fastest solver. 

My time on this puzzle was 11:51 with zero lookups, although I did see the email puzzle newsletter which had a spoiler in it for 27D. Oddly, I had already forgotten that when I solved, an laughed at myself when I finally filled it in. They do say that short-term memory is the first to go...

